<title>USA: Sinter Metals offered 2.2 mln class A shrs.</title>
<headline>Sinter Metals offered 2.2 mln class A shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sinter Metals Inc said Friday it offered 2.2 million shares of Class A common stock as of Thursday at $24 per share.</p>
<p>All shares offered are being sold by Sinter, the company said.</p>
<p>The offering is being lead managed by Morgan Stanley &amp; Co and co-managed by Solomon Brothers Inc and McDonald &amp; Co, Sinter said.</p>
<p>Net proceeds of about $48 million will be used primarily to reduce long-term debt incurred in connection with recent acquisitions, the company said.</p>
</text>
